  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Doing it again and again",
    "kn": "ಮತ್ತೆ ಮತ್ತೆ ಮಾಡುವುದು"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Printing a multiplication table means doing nearly the same thing ten times. Instead of writing ten print statements, we write one loop.",
    "kn": "ಮಗ್ಗಿ ಮುದ್ರಿಸುವುದು ಎಂದರೆ ಒಂದೇ ಕೆಲಸವನ್ನು ಹತ್ತು ಬಾರಿ ಮಾಡುವುದು. ಹತ್ತು print ಹೇಳಿಕೆಗಳ ಬದಲು ಒಂದು ಲೂಪ್ ಬರೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain repetition (iteration)"
    },
    {
     "en": "Write a for loop over a sequence"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use range() with start, stop and step"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Printing a multiplication table means doing nearly the same thing ten times. Instead of writing ten print statements, we write one loop.",
    "kn": "ಮಗ್ಗಿ ಮುದ್ರಿಸುವುದು ಎಂದರೆ ಒಂದೇ ಕೆಲಸವನ್ನು ಹತ್ತು ಬಾರಿ ಮಾಡುವುದು. ಹತ್ತು print ಹೇಳಿಕೆಗಳ ಬದಲು ಒಂದು ಲೂಪ್ ಬರೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Repetition and the for loop"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Repetition (iteration) means executing a set of statements again and again; Python provides the for and while loops. The for loop runs once for every item of a sequence (a range, a string, a list): for <control-variable> in <sequence>: followed by an indented body. In each iteration the control variable takes the next value of the sequence; when the values run out, the loop ends and control passes to the statement after the loop."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "for var in sequence:"
    },
    {
     "en": "One iteration per item"
    },
    {
     "en": "Loop ends when the sequence is exhausted"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Repetition (iteration) means executing a set of statements again and again; Python provides the for and while loops. The for loop runs once for every item of a sequence (a range, a string, a list): for <control-variable> in <sequence>: followed by an indented body. In each iteration the control variable takes the next value of the sequence; when the values run out, the loop ends and control passes to the statement after the loop.",
    "kn": "ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆ ಎಂದರೆ ಹೇಳಿಕೆಗಳನ್ನು ಮತ್ತೆ ಮತ್ತೆ ಕಾರ್ಯಗತಗೊಳಿಸುವುದು. for ಲೂಪ್ ಅನುಕ್ರಮದ ಪ್ರತಿ ಅಂಶಕ್ಕೆ ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಓಡುತ್ತದೆ; ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ ಚರವು ಪ್ರತಿ ಬಾರಿ ಮುಂದಿನ ಮೌಲ್ಯವನ್ನು ಪಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
